# Unreal Engine .gitignore
#
# This repository contains MULTIPLE Unreal projects in subdirectories
# (e.g. Demo/, and more later). The directory patterns below are written
# without leading anchors so they match at ANY depth under this file.
# That way the same rules apply to every project folder automatically.

# Visual Studio user specific files
.vs/

# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Fortran module files
*.mod

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.ipa

# These project files can be generated by the engine
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# Precompiled Assets (matched at any depth)
**/SourceArt/**/*.png
**/SourceArt/**/*.tga

# Binary Files - compiled output, matched at any depth.
# A bare "Binaries/" matches every Binaries folder, including
# the ones inside Plugins/*/Binaries/.
Binaries/

# Builds - ignore generated build files, but keep PakBlacklist + icons.
# "**/" prefix makes it work for every project subfolder.
**/Build/*
!**/Build/*/
**/Build/*/**
!**/Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt
!**/Build/**/*.ico

# Built data for maps
*_BuiltData.uasset

# Per-developer scratch space (personal WIP, named after user/machine)
**/Content/Developers/

# Asset Collections from the Content Browser (usually personal views)
**/Content/Collections/

# Configuration files generated by the Editor (any depth)
Saved/

# Compiled source files for the engine to use (any depth).
# Also covers Plugins/*/Intermediate/.
Intermediate/

# Cache files for the editor to use (any depth)
DerivedDataCache/

# ===== 只跟踪自己的蓝图/逻辑，忽略所有二进制资产（最省方案）=====
# 背景：UE5 资产（贴图/模型/关卡）体积大且为二进制，直接进 git 会撑爆仓库。
# 本仓库策略 = 只版本化「代码 + 自己的蓝图 + 配置 + 文档」，大资产靠 README 手动重新导入。
#
# 默认忽略 Content 下所有直接子项（贴图/模型/关卡等大资产）。
# 用 **/Content/* 而非 **/Content/，是为了能用白名单重新纳入特定子目录。
**/Content/*
# 白名单：自己的蓝图与逻辑文件夹（在任何工程下都生效）。
# 这些目录被重新纳入后，其内部文件不受上面的忽略规则约束，会被正常跟踪。
!**/Content/Code/
!**/Content/Input/
!**/Content/ThirdPerson/
!**/Content/Variant_Combat/

# 兜底：防止误把超大单文件提交进来（再次显式忽略常见大资产扩展名所在的可疑目录，
# 注意：不忽略 *.uasset 本身，否则会连蓝图一起忽略；靠上面的 Content 白名单控制粒度）。

# ===== VitePress 文档站 =====
node_modules/
Docs/.vitepress/cache/
Docs/.vitepress/dist/

# Claude Code 本地权限配置（机器私有，不入库）
.claude/settings.local.json

